{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Why have You dealt ill with Your servant.</b> To send me against my will to bring this people out of Egypt." "<b>And why have I not found favor in Your eyes.</b> When I said, שְׁלַח נָא בְּיַד תִּשְׁלָח (Exodus 4:13)." "<b>To lay the burden of all this people upon me.</b> And this You did in order to lay the burden of all of them upon me, as though You had no leader other than me, so as not to associate with me one who would be good for them."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:39:19.042757998Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}